## 4. Money-figure diff vs master (fresh fixture, not reused from attempt 1)
Built a `git archive 763337f` copy (master) and a `cp -a` copy (branch) in
scratch, both minus .git. Wrote a throwaway probe (discarded after) rendering
"insights-content" with Current=1234.567, Previous=999.994,
Change=234.573/up, three Contributors (123.456/up, -61.728/down, 0.005/up),
one Group (Monthly=12.345, Annual=148.14), Monthly=87.654, Annual=1051.848,
via the SAME rf3Render/rf3Period helpers both trees already carry.
$ python3 -c 'regex extract \$[\d,]+\.\d{2} from both, diff'
master (13 figures): $1,234.57 $234.57 $87.65 $1,234.57 $999.99 $234.57
  $123.46 $61.73 $0.01 $87.65 $1,051.85 $12.35 $148.14
branch (15 figures): same 13, PLUS two more: $12.35 $148.14
Located in branch_out.html:
  line 192-193 (new recurring-strip tile): "$12.35" / "0 series · $148.14 a year"
  line 200 (pre-existing group card, present in master too):
    "0 retained series · Estimated monthly $12.35 · Estimated annual $148.14"
Both instances are the group's own .Monthly/.Annual, byte-for-byte identical
strings ($12.35, $148.14) — exactly the sanctioned exception in brief item 1
("the recurring strip's .Monthly/.Annual figures, which must equal the group
cards' own figures character-for-character"). No other figure differs,
appears, or disappears. No ZgotmplZ in either render
($ grep -c ZgotmplZ master_out.html branch_out.html -> 0, 0).

